# CIPPlatform – Purchase Request (PR) Module
## Phase 1 – Consolidated Functional and Technical Implementation Specification

## 1. Objective and Scope

Implement the Purchase Request module within the existing CIPPlatform application.

Phase 1 is strictly limited to PR functionality.

Reuse existing:
- Authentication and RBAC.
- Employee and Reporting Manager hierarchy.
- Company, Branch, Group and Department masters.
- Business Unit / Plant masters.
- Unit-specific Item Master.
- Item Category and UOM masters.
- General Settings.
- Existing Approval Workflow Engine.
- Existing ERP integration.
- Budget and cost-centre functionality, where available.
- Audit and notification services.

Do not create duplicate masters, standalone applications or separate approval engines.

### Explicitly excluded from Phase 1

Do not implement:
- PO creation or modification.
- Direct PO functionality.
- PR-to-PO conversion.
- Multiple PR consolidation into one PO.
- Partial PR-to-PO allocation.
- PO quantity allocation controls.
- PO approval workflow.
- PO tracking screens.

Keep the PR data model compatible with future PO integration without implementing PO functionality now.

