## 26. Final Mandatory Instructions

- Phase 1 is PR only.
- Do not implement PO functionality.
- Do not fabricate ERP stock, MRP or budget data.
- Support both manual and automatic MRP generation.
- Equipment ID is optional for Repair and Maintenance.
- Duplicate PR detection must warn but allow submission.
- Budget validation is mandatory.
- ERP stock availability must use the existing ERP integration.
- Requester, buyer and authorized administrator may initiate approved PR changes.
- All approved PR changes must follow reapproval.
- Do not bypass mandatory Reporting Manager Level 1 approval.
- Do not hardcode buyer or approval assignments.
- Do not display the PR menu before applicability validation.
- Do not modify existing PO functionality.
- Do not claim production readiness without successful integration and acceptance tests.

